@startuml
allowmixing
set namespaceSeparator none
skinparam componentStyle uml2
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
title API command client (selected implemented types)
component "Smurfs.Domain" as Domain {
  enum Gender
}
component "Smurfs.Application" as Application {
  interface ISmurfReadService
  class "List.Handler" as Handler
  class "List.Query" as Query
  class SmurfDto
  class "PagedList<T>" as Page
}
component "Smurfs.Persistence.API" as Adapter {
  class SmurfsApiClient {
    +UseAccessToken(token) : void
    +GetAccessToken() : string
    +CreateSmurfAsync(name, cancellationToken) : Task
  }
  class ApiUser
  class ApiException
}
component "Smurfs.UI.Console.API" as Console {
  class Program
  class ApiConsole
  interface ITokenStore
  class WindowsTokenStore
}
SmurfsApiClient .up.|> ISmurfReadService
SmurfsApiClient .up.> Gender : JSON converter
SmurfsApiClient .up.> SmurfDto : decodes
SmurfsApiClient .up.> Page : constructs
SmurfsApiClient --> ApiUser : returns from login
SmurfsApiClient ..> ApiException : reports HTTP status
Handler --> ISmurfReadService : requests page
Handler ..> Query : handles
ISmurfReadService ..> SmurfDto : item type
ISmurfReadService ..> Page : returns
SmurfDto .up.> Gender : optional value
Program ..> ApiConsole : constructs / dispatches
Program ..> WindowsTokenStore : constructs
Program .up.> SmurfsApiClient : constructs
Program .up.> ApiException : handles failures
ApiConsole --> ITokenStore : reads / saves / deletes
WindowsTokenStore .up.|> ITokenStore
ApiConsole .up.> SmurfsApiClient : login / token / create
ApiConsole .up.> ApiUser : displays account
ApiConsole .up.> ApiException : handles 401
ApiConsole .up.> Handler : invokes
ApiConsole .up.> Query : constructs
ApiConsole .up.> Page : prints totals
ApiConsole .up.> SmurfDto : prints names
legend bottom
  Components represent production assemblies.
  Selected direct type dependencies; verb DTOs, BCL, native fields,
  and internal wire models omitted. Server communication is HTTP.
  Windows Credential Manager is native OS infrastructure.
  Unimplemented repository/unit-of-work skeletons are outside this view.
endlegend
@enduml
